rooms_desc ({"As you look around the entrace room you see windows which when you look outsee your yard which need some work mainly because you've spent to muchtime on the computer.  To the east there is a coat rack, where you can hang up your equipment, and to the west you see a stool where you cansit down and take off your shoes.  Behind the stool there is a mirror,and maybe you can see yourself in it.  To the north there is a doorwhich leads to the main house.","This is the main living area of the house, there is a table, chair, a T.V. and Mirror.  Maybe you can look in the mirror?  This is the roomwhere frost goes after his hard days.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
